	(text "100 kHz initial bus; scope rise time with real cable / pullups.\nFixed 4.7k pullups: assess parallel host pullups before use.\nALERT is open drain; disabled until firmware enables it.\n100n local bypass; bulk capacitance supplied by host.\nNo ESD / level shifting / reverse-polarity protection.\nUnbuilt DRAFT: temperature accuracy and fit unqualified.\nSources + calculations: DESIGN_BASIS.md, evidence/index.yaml"
